  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 425°F (220°C).",
    "In a bowl, whisk together olive oil, garlic, chili flakes, cumin, smoked paprika, salt, and pepper.",
    "Add the mung bean sprouts to the marinade and toss to coat.",
